{{> Top frame}}
<header>
  <p class="kicker">Speed</p>
  <h1>Measured here, now.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Not a benchmark: your machine, your browser, this app. Save a template and
  watch the clock; race your browser against roux-load.</p>
</header>

<section class="card" id="edit">
  <div class="card-head">
    <h2>Save to pixels</h2>
    <p>Edit <code>templates/Hello.rocstache</code>, save, look back.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="preview">
    <figcaption><code>templates/Hello.rocstache</code>, rendered</figcaption>
{{> Hello hello}}  </figure>
  <div class="clock">
    <div class="readout"><b data-roux="total">–</b><small>save to pixels</small></div>
    <div class="phases">
      <div class="track" data-roux="track"><i class="p-roux"></i><i class="p-net"></i><i class="p-ready"></i><i class="p-paint"></i></div>
      <dl class="legend">
        <div><dt><i class="p-roux"></i>roux</dt><dd data-roux="roux">–</dd><small>save seen, bytecode made, app told</small></div>
        <div><dt><i class="p-net"></i>page back</dt><dd data-roux="net">–</dd><small>reload asked, HTML arrived</small></div>
        <div><dt><i class="p-ready"></i>page ready</dt><dd data-roux="ready">–</dd><small>parsed, styles and scripts in</small></div>
        <div><dt><i class="p-paint"></i>painted</dt><dd data-roux="paint">–</dd><small>the browser's next frame</small></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ol class="history" data-roux="history"></ol>
  <p class="note" data-roux="note">Waiting for your first save.</p>
</section>

<section class="card" id="race">
  <div class="card-head">
    <h2>Drag race</h2>
    <p>Each lane raced twice: by your browser, then by roux-load. Two seconds each.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="start">
    <button data-roux="go">Race</button>
    <span class="lights" data-roux="lights" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
  </div>

  <div class="duel" data-roux="duel">
    <div class="duel-head">
      <div class="side browser"><b>your browser</b><small>fetch, four at a time</small></div>
      <div></div>
      <div class="side raw"><b>roux-load</b><small>io_uring, 64 connections</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="duel-rows" data-roux="duel-rows"></div>
  </div>

  <p class="note" data-roux="race-note" hidden></p>
  <p class="fine">"app" is the app's own time, from <code>Server-Timing</code>. Under
  <code>roux dev</code> the app gets two cores; a build gets them all. Nightly races:
  <a href="https://fourneau.y2kbugger.com/">fourneau.y2kbugger.com</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <div class="card-head"><h2>Small, and quick to build</h2></div>
  <dl class="facts">
    <div><dt>&lt; 1 ms</dt><dd>a markup edit: new bytecode, no compiler</dd></div>
    <div><dt data-roux="roc">~1 s</dt><dd>a Roc edit: roc compiles, the app restarts</dd></div>
    <div><dt>~3 MB</dt><dd><code>./roux build main.roc</code>: the whole app, one file</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>
<script src="/speed.js"></script>
{{> Bottom nav}}
